8
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:27,080
Skips 576 + 529 = 1105, trims 875.

9
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:36,920
OpusHead pre-skip: 312 samples = 6.5 ms.

10
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:48,160
Click at 4800 in ogg, mkv and .opus.

11
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:59,200
