13
00:02:07,090 --> 00:02:18,340
Edit list: 2000 ms from media time 1024.

14
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:28,180
Edit list ignored: 90,112 samples, not 89,088.

15
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:39,690
-itsoffset 1: empty edit of 1000 ms.

16
00:02:39,690 --> 00:02:49,560
-itsoffset -1: mp4 skips 48,000 samples.

17
00:02:49,560 --> 00:03:01,970
Join: edit list 4024 ms from media time 0.

18
00:03:01,970 --> 00:03:10,240
180,224 decoded vs 176,400: 3,824 extra.

19
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:23,790
Copy join: seam 2,112 = 200 + 888 + 1,024.

20
00:03:23,790 --> 00:03:30,570
Re-encode, no trim: seam 1,088.

21
00:03:30,570 --> 00:03:41,820
-ss 0.5 -c copy: new tag, delay 3567.

22
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:50,250
3,981 late. Re-encode: exact at 22,050.

23
00:03:50,250 --> 00:04:01,970
