25
00:04:09,790 --> 00:04:18,080
Join AAC: trim, concat, encode once.

26
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:26,370
Exact cut: re-encode. Keep the tag.

27
00:04:26,370 --> 00:04:35,170
Clicks: 100, 88100, 88300, 176300.

28
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:49,250
Seam 200. Edit list 4000 ms, 174 packets.

29
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:57,850
MP3: tag. Opus: header. AAC: edit list.

30
00:04:57,850 --> 00:05:07,670
